        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MUcVJ-yDYPPZjpZu1q4jIFkDpJc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-51304-bills-sausage-gravy-DDMFS-step-1-398b83a8778649aba5651d1efdf33667.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/51304/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place sausage in a large, deep skillet. Cook and crumble over medium-high heat until evenly brown.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kdFCZ8ynX6bH8iLfx2IncefVICw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-51304-bills-sausage-gravy-DDMFS-step-2-f789af3e5817455eaf2f24058e48ff77.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/51304/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove sausage with a slotted spoon, leaving the drippings in the pan. Stir butter into the pan until melted.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/A05ARpIeIhFTRCJ0djjgtZfrw2E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-51304-bills-sausage-gravy-DDMFS-step-3-976996cb369d4b098c26c9ba6467fe97.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/51304/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add flour and stir until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fRYLZiXqz0AgtGZdriEv_CfXdIc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-51304-bills-sausage-gravy-DDMFS-step-4-6921f000e6144472846c47155d4f0c60.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/51304/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduce heat to medium and cook until light brown.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/J2g-VaHRvRqCiee9Tp98EZUOzbs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-51304-bills-sausage-gravy-DDMFS-step-5-e1a9c122e704418c8039bf1fc752401e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/51304/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gradually whisk in milk and cook until thickened. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/q1KYuH-SZsIfOiDRGjXNJ06KWv0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-51304-bills-sausage-gravy-DDMFS-step-6-f7c6ff1cc0ac43078a8407992e24ae17.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/51304/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add cooked sausage back to the skillet. Reduce heat and simmer for 12 to 15 minutes. If gravy becomes too thick, stir in a little more milk.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MgyeOQd84O1cft9XDwp5euFJS1I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-51304-bills-sausage-gravy-DDMFS-step-7-f1c909c424c24abca5db6d8a58c40442.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/51304/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve over biscuits and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
